- I am looking out for her.
- It's exactly what Gordon was afraid of.

733
00:39:53.683 --> 00:39:54.683
Excuse me?

734
00:39:57.813 --> 00:39:59.481
No. Tell me what Gordon was afraid of.

735
00:40:00.357 --> 00:40:03.985
That Ramona's New York City siblings
would come corrupt her?

736
00:40:04.069 --> 00:40:05.362
Is that why he kept us apart?

737
00:40:05.445 --> 00:40:07.280
- I'm curious.
- That's not what I said.

738
00:40:07.364 --> 00:40:10.617
Do you honestly expect me to believe
that you didn't see my mom for years

739
00:40:10.700 --> 00:40:13.787
even though you lived here
and she lived there.

740
00:40:13.870 --> 00:40:16.331
- and she was dying of cancer?
- Annie. it was just…

741
00:40:16.998 --> 00:40:19.668
- It was complicated then. okay?
- What? What was complicated?

742
00:40:22.504 --> 00:40:24.047
- It's not my place.
- To what?

743
00:40:24.131 --> 00:40:25.465
To tell you how she died.

744
00:40:28.802 --> 00:40:29.970
What did you just say?

745
00:40:32.973 --> 00:40:34.474
She died giving birth…

746
00:40:35.892 --> 00:40:36.892
to Ramona.

747
00:40:37.727 --> 00:40:39.729
No. she didn't. She died of cancer.

748
00:40:49.030 --> 00:40:50.115
How do you know that?

749
00:40:53.076 --> 00:40:54.202
Because I was there.

750
00:40:55.305 --> 00:41:55.476
